WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.301
Today is a short check, and then a game. No new sounds.

2
00:00:03.751 --> 00:00:10.115
Your child says the sound of each of the twelve letters. They are the six sounds so far, each one twice.

3
00:00:10.565 --> 00:00:14.377
Then the six pictures. Your child says the first sound of each one.

4
00:00:14.827 --> 00:00:17.391
Do not help on this page. Mark what was right.

5
00:00:17.841 --> 00:00:20.902
Ten or more of the twelve letters, go on to day six.

6
00:00:21.352 --> 00:00:29.123
Fewer than ten, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal, and it is not falling behind.

7
00:00:29.573 --> 00:00:33.933
New sounds on top of sounds that are still slipping is how they all get lost.

8
00:00:34.383 --> 00:00:40.945
Then play the game on the next page. Your child says each sound and colors its stone, all the way to the end.
